			"10": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": false
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: SCROLLING THROUGH PERLIN\n\nIn this example we can see how the Perlin node always produces the same output with a given input. \nThe X-Position node returns a float from -2 to 2 which is used to move the Circle nodes over the X-axis.\nThe red Circle simply moves from -2 to 2, the original signal.\nThe blue Circle moves through the noise hash, resulting in a random-looking -1 to 1 result."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 362.84503173828125,
					"width": 1657,
					"x": -158,
					"y": 307.5826416015625
				},
				"class": {
					"id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
					"version": 1
				},
				"clock": "video",
				"color": "ff02bbff",
				"constants": {},
				"hidden": [
					"text",
					"alignment",
					"font-size",
					"fill"
				],
				"name": "Group",
				"thumbnail_visible": true
			},
			"11": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": true
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "PERLIN\n\nThe Perlin node takes any float type, runs it through a perlin noise algorithm, and outputs a float within a -1 to 1 range. The output value will always be the same with a given input value. \n\nThe Perlin node is a useful tool for generative images as its output can be replicated infinitely.\nThis allows you to scroll forwards and backwards and jump through the noise hash.\n\nIf you don't need this amount of control and just want to generate perlin noise, use the Perlin Generator node instead."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 221.5831146240234375,
					"width": 667.91802978515625,
					"x": -156.324951171875,
					"y": 47.12169265747070312
				},
				"class": {
