					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: PERLIN TO TEXTURE\n\nIn this example we use a Saw Oscillator to \"move\" through the Perlin noise.\nNext, we convert the float data to a Texture2Dchannel signal using the Texture to Data node.\nFinally we apply the Polar and Color Offset effects to create a prism-like image."
					}
				},
